10. Architectural and engineering principles evaluation
================================================================================
1. High cohesion & low coupling:
   - Article components encapsulate content cleanly.
   - Public imports only (PublicPicture, BlogSources). No private ops imports.
   - Registry and identities cleanly decoupled.
2. Single responsibility principle (SRP):
   - English module uses focused sub-renderers orchestrated by HouseUpgradeStardewEnglishArticle.
   - Chinese module directly renders article elements cleanly.
3. Public interface communication:
   - Exported functions: HouseUpgradeStardewEnglishArticle, HouseUpgradeStardewChineseArticle.
   - Registry imports public exports only.
4. KISS:
   - Direct JSX elements, simple semantic structure. No redundant abstractions or complexity.
5. Fail fast & data integrity:
   - Registry validation verifies order, slug uniqueness, and covers on startup.
   - Missing slugs trigger notFound().
6. YAGNI:
   - No premature generalizations or unused CMS fields.
7. Precise naming:
   - Explicit, unambiguous component, asset, and route identifiers. No generic "data"/"temp" names.

